WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:07.096
Scraps logs edible food waste. All amounts in this walkthrough are made-up demonstration inputs.

2
00:00:07.096 --> 00:00:14.181
The example week totals 2.03 kg. Emissions and water figures are estimates based on global averages.

3
00:00:14.181 --> 00:00:21.191
Beef leads by estimated emissions. The annual figure is a conditional scenario, not verified savings.

4
00:00:21.191 --> 00:00:28.223
Switch to weight: milk ranks first. The example never overwrites your personal log.

5
00:00:28.223 --> 00:00:35.371
Demo inputs: 200 g of bread last week and 100 g this week. Unchecked days remain missing data.

6
00:00:35.371 --> 00:00:44.837
After confirming all 14 days, the demo shows 50% less recorded weight. This is not evidence of real-world impact.
